# Pokemon Battle Simulator - Project Rules

Project rules have been moved to `.cursor/rules/` for better organization.

See:
- `.cursor/rules/project-overview.mdc` - Structure, run commands
- `.cursor/rules/python-backend.mdc` - Flask, src/
- `.cursor/rules/security.mdc` - Path validation, config validation
- `.cursor/rules/frontend-react.mdc` - React, Vite, Tailwind
- `.cursor/rules/api-conventions.mdc` - API responses, error handling
- `.cursor/rules/code-style.mdc` - Naming, formatting
- `.cursor/rules/data-files.mdc` - Data/, scripts, config
- `.cursor/rules/accessibility-ux.mdc` - A11y, form labels, feedback
